        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hume Auctioneers - We Get The Pick Of The Crop\n\nSituated in a most sought-after location within walking distance of Portlaoise town centre and all its amenities, this beautiful extended 3-bedroom home offers all the fine features of a quality family home.\n\nAttractively set back from the rood the property enjoys ample parking and vehicular access to the side and rear.\n\nWith immense kerb appeal and beautiful gardens, this is one of the most attractive homes to be found anywhere on the market today.\n\nThe ground-floor accommodation is bright, spacious and superbly laid out for modern family living. A welcoming entrance hall, finished with attractive tiled flooring, leads to a generously proportioned sitting room featuring a large picture window and an elegant feature fireplace.\n\nTo the rear lies an impressive kitchen and dining room. This excellent family space is fitted with an extensive range of bespoke units, tiled splashbacks and a convenient breakfast peninsula. There is ample room for a large dining table, making it ideal for everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nSliding doors open into a delightful sunroom, beautifully positioned to enjoy views over the rear garden. Glazed on three sides and with double doors leading outside, this versatile room provides a peaceful additional living space throughout the year.\n\nThe bright first-floor landing leads to three well-proportioned bedrooms. Each room is attractively presented in neutral tones and enjoys excellent natural light. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation and is fitted with a bath, wash-hand basin and WC.\n\n Convenient landing storage is also provided.\n\nThe entire is meticulously presented, spotlessly clean and in move in condition.\n\nThe rear garden is delightful. A beautiful terraced garden magnificently planted and laid, this space is a perfect private haven, not overlooked from the rear.\n\nThere is an attractive patio area and a very good garden shed.\n\nThe new Portlaoise Bus Service stops adjacent giving round the clock access to Portlaoise Hospiatal, Train Station, Schools and all amenities.\n\nThere are two secondary schools within a 10 minute walk.\n\nViewing of this beautiful home is highly recommended.\n"
